com/photo/msid-134356533,imgsize-95042.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scottish gran thought she won a horse, then discovered £15 ticket had won her a £4m Cornwall mansion]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134355407.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A 72-year-old Scottish grandmother thought she had won a horse after being contacted by Omaze, only to discover her £15 entry had won a £4 million Cornwall mansion. The mortgage-free property comes with £250,000 cash and £200,000 in furnishings, leaving Mary Dickson and husband John stunned by their life-changing prize.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-72-year-old-scottish-gran-thought-shed-won-a-horse-then-discovered-her-15-ticket-had-won-her-a-4-million-cornwall-mansion-mortgage-free-plus-250000-cash-and-200000-worth-of-furnishings/articleshow/134355407.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-72-year-old-scottish-gran-thought-shed-won-a-horse-then-discovered-her-15-ticket-had-won-her-a-4-million-cornwall-mansion-mortgage-free-plus-250000-cash-and-200000-worth-of-furnishings/articleshow/134355407.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-19T19:33:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134355504,imgsize-111818.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Everett Leigh, the teenage pianist using music to help foster children by generating $2M]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134354312.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[At just sixteen, Everett Leigh shines as a gifted pianist who believes in giving back. He created EverEverest, a nonprofit dedicated to empowering foster and underserved youth through music. With over fifty organized benefit concerts under his belt, he has raised substantial funds to support these children. His inspiring efforts earned him the Barron Prize for Young Heroes, showcasing his commitment to balancing his piano career with meaningful philanthropy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-everett-leigh-the-16-year-old-california-pianist-who-organised-50-benefit-concerts-raised-70000-and-helped-generate-another-2-million-for-foster-youth/articleshow/134354312.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-everett-leigh-the-16-year-old-california-pianist-who-organised-50-benefit-concerts-raised-70000-and-helped-generate-another-2-million-for-foster-youth/articleshow/134354312.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-19T19:05:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134354478,imgsize-540926.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[After a century, Maine's Penobscot Nation gets 11,297 acres back; $32.5M effort targets 30,000+]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134330136.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Maine forest land returns to Penobscot Nation in September 2026. This marks the first phase of restoring over thirty thousand acres of homeland. The project began in 2023 with a fundraising goal of thirty-two point five million dollars. Currently, twenty point seven million dollars has been raised for the ongoing effort. Ownership grants the Penobscot Nation greater authority over land management and conservation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/more-than-a-century-after-maines-penobscot-nation-lost-control-of-much-of-its-ancestral-landscape-11297-acres-have-now-been-returned-the-wider-32-5-million-effort-aims-to-return-more-than-30000-acres/articleshow/134330136.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/more-than-a-century-after-maines-penobscot-nation-lost-control-of-much-of-its-ancestral-landscape-11297-acres-have-now-been-returned-the-wider-32-5-million-effort-aims-to-return-more-than-30000-acres/articleshow/134330136.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-19T19:05:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134330324,imgsize-1653758.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Khyber Pakhtunkhwa bombing: Pakistan identifies 'Afghan national' among attackers]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134355095.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/khyber-pakhtunkhwa-bombing-pakistan-identifies-afghan-national-among-attackers/articleshow/134355095.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/khyber-pakhtunkhwa-bombing-pakistan-identifies-afghan-national-among-attackers/articleshow/134355095.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-19T19:06:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134355198,imgsize-284120.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[What does Trump's new order on layoffs mean? How is it going to impact H-1B Indians?]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134354704.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-does-trumps-new-order-on-layoffs-mean-how-is-it-going-to-impact-h-1b-indians/articleshow/134354704.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.i